/services/temporal  (host 4100, container 4100)
================================================================================

PORT=4100

TEMPORAL_TASK_QUEUE=stage7-watch
  Task queue TemporalClient starts watch workflows on
  (TemporalClient.ts:1550).

GATEWAY_URL=http://gateway:3000
WORKER_POOL_URL=http://worker-pool:3200
BRAIN_URL=http://brain:3100
ARTIFACTS_URL=http://artifacts:4200
PERSISTENCE_URL=
  ARTIFACTS_URL is used first; PERSISTENCE_URL is a legacy fallback for the
  artifacts base.
TOOL_EXECUTOR_URL=http://tool-executor:3500
AGENT_RUNTIME_URL=http://agent-runtime:3400

AGENT_RUNTIME_TIMEOUT_MS=1860000
  Agent runtime request timeout. Default: BRAIN_COMPLETION_DEADLINE_MS plus
  60s, or 900000 when that is unset.

APPROVAL_TIMEOUT_MS=86400000
APPROVAL_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=3000
  Mission approval wait budget and polling interval.

WATCH_SCHEDULER_POLL_MS=60000
  Watch-scheduler polling interval.

================================================================================
/services/vault  (host 4000, container 4000)
================================================================================

PORT=4000

MASTER_KEY=
  Envelope-encryption master key. Default: "default-master-key-change-me",
  which is not safe outside a scratch install. Generate with
  "openssl rand -hex 32".

MONGO_URI=mongodb://mongo:27017
MONGO_DB=stage7
  Secret store backing.

AUTH_URL=http://auth:4300
  Auth service base used when resolving tenants. Default: http://auth:4300.

VAULT_DEFAULT_TENANT=
  Default tenant when a request does not carry one. Default: system.

================================================================================
/services/artifacts  (host 4200, container 4200)
================================================================================

PORT=4200

MONGO_URI=mongodb://mongo:27017
MONGO_DB=stage7
MONGO_SERVER_SELECTION_TIMEOUT_MS=5000

ARTIFACTS_LOCAL_DIR=
  Filesystem storage root. Takes precedence over S3 when set.
ARTIFACTS_LOCAL_BASE_URL=
  Public URL prefix served for files in ARTIFACTS_LOCAL_DIR.

ARTIFACTS_S3_BUCKET=
ARTIFACTS_S3_REGION=us-east-1
ARTIFACTS_S3_ENDPOINT=
ARTIFACTS_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
  Falls back to AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID.
ARTIFACTS_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
  Falls back to AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY.

================================================================================
/services/auth  (host 4300, container 4300)
================================================================================

PORT=4300

MONGO_URI=mongodb://mongo:27017
MONGO_DB=stage7
  User and token store. In-memory only when MONGO_URI is unset.

ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-in-production
ADMIN_TENANT=tenant-1
  Seed administrator created on first boot when no user with that email
  exists. The default password is public; set both before exposing the stack.

JWT_SECRET=
  Secret used to sign and verify auth-service JWTs. Deployments must set a
  strong, unique value; when unset the service falls back to the built-in
  'dev-secret-key' (development only — a warning is emitted at startup).

================================================================================
/services/frontend (frontend-nextgen)
================================================================================

No environment variables. The image is a static Vite build served by nginx,
which proxies /api and /ws to http://gateway:3000 on the mcs_network network
(frontend-nextgen/nginx.conf). There is no REACT_APP_* or VITE_* wiring; the
host port is set in docker-compose.yaml.
